OL,3,GNEWSAPatients protest over hydrotherapy
OL,4,Apool closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients staged a protest outside a
OL,7,Fhospital in a bid to save a
OL,8,Fhydrotherapy pool from proposed cuts.
OL,10,FHundreds of people use the pool at
OL,11,FKing's Mill Hospital in
OL,12,FSutton-in-Ashfield, Nottinghamshire,
OL,13,Fevery year, but it was revealed last
OL,14,Fmonth health bosses wanted to close it.
OL,16,FSherwood Forest Hospitals NHS
OL,17,FFoundation Trust said this had been
OL,18,Fdone as it tried to save #35m this
OL,19,Ffinancial year and review services.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
