OL,3,GNEWSAPatients protest over hydrotherapy
OL,4,Apool closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, several patients and
OL,7,Fmembers of the GMB union, representing
OL,8,Fhospital staff, took a stand against
OL,9,Fthe closure outside the hospital.
